  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là giao điểm của hai đường trung tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo acce